# Postgres connection string.
#
# On Vercel: add a Postgres store (Storage -> Create Database -> Neon) and this
# variable is injected automatically — you do not need to set it by hand.
#
# Locally: copy this file to `.env.local` and paste a connection string.
# Without it the app still runs and saves labels in the browser's localStorage.
#
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host/dbname?sslmode=require"
